   "arg": "\"你知道的太多了\""
  },
  {
   "text": "\r\n　　As we know ,we can't type § into the chatbox. So can we type the Unicode of § into the chatbox?\r\n　　The answer to the question is no.\r\n　　So can we type it by using tellraw?\r\n　　I can say, the way is feasible in Minecraft Java 1.12.2.\r\n　　Now, let us run Minecraft Java 1.12.2, and create a new world in creative mode. Remember to allow cheats.\r\n　　After the world was created, please run the following command:\r\n\r\n"
  },
  {
   "tag": "CENTER",
   "raw": "[CENTER]"
  },
  {
   "tag": "FONT",
   "raw": "[FONT=Unifont]",
   "arg": "Unifont"
  },
  {
   "text": "/give @s command_block"
  },
  {
   "tag": "FONT",
   "raw": "[/FONT]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "tag": "CENTER",
   "raw": "[/CENTER]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "text": "\r\n\r\n　　I'm sure that you must have a command block now. Please set it on the ground.\r\n　　Right click to open the GUI, then enter the following command:\r\n\r\n"
  },
  {
   "tag": "CENTER",
   "raw": "[CENTER]"
  },
  {
   "tag": "FONT",
   "raw": "[FONT=Unifont]",
   "arg": "Unifont"
  },
  {
   "text": "/tellraw @p {\"text\":\"\\u00a7bHello Minecraft\"}"
  },
  {
   "tag": "FONT",
   "raw": "[/FONT]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "tag": "CENTER",
   "raw": "[/CENTER]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "text": "\r\n\r\n　　Click the Done button to return the game. Take a lever out of your bag. Set it next the command block.\r\n　　Now let's pull the lever. The moment the lever is pulled, a line of "
  },
  {
   "tag": "COLOR",
   "raw": "[COLOR=rgb(85, 255, 255)]",
   "arg": "rgb(85, 255, 255)"
  },
  {
   "text": "light blue text"
  },
  {
   "tag": "COLOR",
   "raw": "[/COLOR]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "text": " appear surprisedly! Yes, as you looked, we can use the Unicode of § in JSON Text! Have you learned it?\r\n　　"
  },
  {
   "tag": "BGCOLOR",
   "raw": "[BGCOLOR=rgb(147, 101, 184)]",
   "arg": "rgb(147, 101, 184)"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you want to learn about it more, please search \"在原版中更改任意文字颜色\" in MCBBS. You will find a post by a great command veteran in 2015."
  },
  {
   "tag": "BGCOLOR",
   "raw": "[/BGCOLOR]",
   "close": true
  },
  {
   "text": " "
  },
  {
   "tag": "I",
   "raw": "[I]"
  },
  {
   "text": "PS: You cannot find it anymore because MCBBS is dead."
  },
